  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Capacity Development of the Tanzania Peacekeeping Training Centre (TPTC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aim to enhance the capacity of the TPTC to effectively train personnel in peacekeeping operations. This one-year initiative has been developed by UNDP in close collaboration with relevant stakeholders. Consultation with TPTC. Contributing Outcome (UNSDCF, CPD, RPD): CPD Outcome 3: People in the United Republic of Tanzania, especially the most vulnerable, participate in and benefit from government institutions and systems that promote peace and justice, are gender responsive, inclusive, accountable, representative, and compliant with international human rights norms and standards.</narrative>
  </description>
